<section class="making" id="making" data-chapter="The making" aria-label="The making of the Eclisse loveseat">
    <div class="stage lt" id="mstage">
      <img class="fallback" data-img="eclisse" alt="The Eclisse loveseat under its arc lamp">
      <canvas id="gl2" aria-label="The Eclisse loveseat shown as a pencil drawing, a full-size model, the finished piece and lit by its lamp; at the end you can turn it and change its colour"></canvas>
      <span class="mnum" id="mnum" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <div class="txt"><div class="in">
        <div id="mhead"><p class="kicker" style="color:inherit;opacity:.7">Chapter 4 · How one piece is made</p><h2>The making <br>of Eclisse</h2>
          <div class="segs" id="segs"><i>Drawn</i><i>Modelled</i><i>Made</i><i>Lit</i><i>Yours</i></div></div>
        <div></div>
        <div class="msteps">
          <div class="mstep on"><p class="sn">Step 1 of 4</p><h3>Drawn</h3><p class="who">Ange Nicole Mukundwa, founder and design</p><p>The shell is one line that rises from the arms and rounds over the back. The lamp is drawn on the same sheet, never after.</p></div>
          <div class="mstep"><p class="sn">Step 2 of 4</p><h3>Modelled</h3><p class="who">The studio</p><p>Before any wood is cut, the form is built at full size and sat in, so the curve fits a back and the arm fits a hand.</p></div>
          <div class="mstep"><p class="sn">Step 3 of 4</p><h3>Made</h3><p class="who">The frame and cover workshops</p><p>The frame is joined, the cover is cut and sewn by hand, in the wood and fabric the client chooses.</p></div>
          <div class="mstep"><p class="sn">Step 4 of 4</p><h3>Lit</h3><p class="who">The lamp room</p><p>The arc lamp is built for this loveseat and set where the shadow falls right. That place is written on its lighting note.</p></div>
          <div class="mstep play" id="play"><p class="sn">Now it is yours</p><h3>Make it yours.</h3>
            <div class="sw" id="msw" role="group" aria-label="Colour of the cover"></div>
            <div class="row"><button class="pill" id="lampbtn" type="button" aria-pressed="true">Lamp on</button><a class="pill lit" id="mcta" href="#visit" data-piece="Eclisse">Request this Eclisse</a></div>
            <p class="hint">Drag the loveseat to turn it.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
